風險額1．make a total of總計
*The total income amounts to ＄5，000．總收入合計5000美元。
2．signify；mean equal to表示；有重要性；等於
*Her words amount to a refusal．她的話等於拒絕。
*What he said amounted to very little．他說的話無關緊要。
*His suggestion amounts to saying that there is still room for improvement in the work．他的建議意味著這件工作尚有改進的餘地。
3．achieve success；develop into有成就；發展為
*I don't think such a man can amount to much．我認為這樣一個人不會有什麼作為。
*If he goes on like this，he will never amount to anything．如果他一味這樣下去，將一事無成。a.mour
