(1 古羅馬的銅幣; 2 古羅馬的重量單位,等於一金衡量磅)in reality；to speak the truth事實上
*As a matter of fact， I have never heard of him． 事實上，我從沒有聽說過他。
*He has，as a matter of fact，no real convictions．他實際上並沒有真正的信念。therefore； consequently因此；結果
*As a result he remained unknown and lived away from his family for more than 20 years．結果，他隱姓埋名，遠離家人達20多年。
*He refused to have medical attention in the early stages of his complaint，and as a result he became seriously ill．他在得病初期拒絕接受治療，結果病情嚴重惡化。generally；customarily通常；一般
*As a rule， he gets up at five o'clock and does morning exercises in the park．他通常5點起床，在公園裡做早操。
*When does he come as a rule？通常他什麼時候來？all together；not taken separately；in general就整體而言
*We should view things as a whole．我們應該全面地看問題。
*The speech had to be considered as a whole．應該從整體來考慮這篇講話。as written or stated next如下；如此
*The regulations are as follows．規定如下。concerning；with regard to至於；就…而言
*As for that man， he is not qualified for the job at all．至於那人，他幹這項工作根本不稱職。
*He likes summer， but as for me， I like winter much better．他喜歡夏天，但是對我來說，我則更喜歡冬天。1．the same as同…一樣
*He is as good as dead．他像死了一樣。
*The wellmaintained TV set looks as good as new．這部保養良好的電視機看上去跟新的一樣。
2．practically；almost實際上；幾乎是
*What he did has as good as shown that he is dishonest．他的行為實際上表明他是個不誠實的人。
*This means that the dollar is as good as devalued．這意味著美元實際上已經貶值。as it would be if似乎；好像（後面的從句一般用虛擬語氣）
*He behaves as if he were mad．他的舉動好像發了瘋似的。
*She looks as though she had seen a ghost．她那樣子看上去就像見了鬼似的。
*He talks as if he knew all about it．他說話的口氣好像他全部已經知道了。1．really；in reality事實上
*We hoped that things would get better，but as it is， they are getting worse．我們本希望情況會好轉的，但是事實上，現在情況正在惡化。
*He seemed to be around fifty， but as it was， he was over sixty．他看上去只有 50歲左右，但事實上他已經60多歲了。
*As it is， he is a noblehearted man with profound thinking．事實上，他是一個心靈高尚，思想深刻的人。
2．without changes or improvements（used after the word it modifies）照原來的樣子（位於被修飾詞之後）
