*They agree to buy the house just as it is．他們同意照房子原狀買下來。1．in a manner；as if it really were 宛如；似乎
*Her mother is， as it were，her friend．她的母親好像就是她的朋友。
*He is，as it were，a walking dictionary．他彷彿是部活字典。
2．so to speak可以說
