*He made six mistakes in as many paragraphs．他在6段裡錯了6處。the same；exactly that同樣；那樣
*Did you lose your way？ I thought as much when you were late in coming．你迷路了嗎？你來遲了，我就料想你迷路了。with reference to；concerning關於
*As regards attending the meeting，I haven't decided yet．關於那個會議，我還沒有決定是否參加。
*He was always secretive as regards his family．關於他的家庭情況，他總是守口如瓶。immediately；the moment一…就…
