*She is a child，and must be regarded as such．她是個孩子，必須當成孩子來看待。as the saying is俗話說
*「All is not gold that glitters，」as the saying goes．俗話說得好，「閃光的並不都是金子。」1．concerning；with regard to至於（後接名詞位於句首）
*As to Jack，I believe he wouldn't have said anything like that．至於傑克，我相信他不會那麼說的。
*As to your final grade，that depends on your final examination．至於你的總成績，那要根據你的期末考試而定。
2．in connection with關於（後接句子）
*They have not decided yet as to who will be in charge of the project．關於誰將負責這項工程，他們還沒有作出決定。
