*I would go home， as usual， for Christmas．跟往常一樣，我將回家過聖誕節。in addition；also；too也；一樣地；依然（位於句尾）
*I am going to Paris and my brother is going as well．我要到巴黎去，我弟弟也去。in addition to， besides和；同；既…又
