at
[輕讀)ɑt, It; ɑt; (重讀)at; at]
<<介係詞>>
1 
a. 在…,於…
at a point 
在一點上
at the center 
在中心
at a distance 
在隔一段距離處,隔著一段距離
at the foot [top] of a hill 
在山腳 [山頂] 
Open your book ~ page 30. 
翻開書的第三十頁
He bought it at the store over there. 
他在那邊的商店買了它
He was educated at Oxford. 
他在牛津大學受教育
He is a student at Yale. 
他是耶魯大學的學生
He lives at 32 Westway. 
他住在西道三十二號
b. 由…
enter at the front door 
由前門進入
look out at the window 
在窗口往外看
Let's begin at Chapter Three. 
我們從第三章開始吧
c. 到達
arrive at one's destination 
到達目的地
d. (出席[參加]) 在…
at a meeting 
在會上
at the theater 
在劇院,在觀賞戲劇
at a wedding 
參加婚禮
He was at university from 1980 to 1984. 
他在 1980 年到 1984 年間在大學讀書
2 
a. 在…
School begins at nine and ends at four. 
學校在九時開始上課,在四時下課
at noon 
在正午
at dinner time 
在正餐 [晚餐] 時
at present 
目前,現在
at that time 
當時
at the beginning [end] of the month 
在月初 [月底] 
at the same time 
同時
at this time of (the) year 
在這個季節,在每年的這個時候
at Christmas 
在耶誕節
at the weekend (
英)在週末
b. 在…歲時
at (the age of) seven 
在七歲時
3 
a. 在…
at the second attempt 
在第二次嘗試時
at first 
最初
at last 
最後; 終於
b. 
at long [short] intervals 
偶爾 [時時] 
at all times 
總是,經常
at times 
有時,間或
c. [at a [an,one] ?] 一次 [一口,一飲 (等) ] 地
at a time 
一次
at a mouthful 
一口
at one [a] gulp 
一飲
4 對 (准) …,向…
look at the moon 
向月亮看
aim at a target 
瞄準靶子
What is he aiming at?. 
他的意圖 [目的] 是什麼?
guess at 
? 猜測…
hint at 
? 暗示…
laugh at a person ( 
嘲) 笑某人
He made an attempt at a solution of the problem. 
他試圖解決那問題
5 因接到…,因見到…,因聽到…,因想到…,in an unfavourable position處境不利
*He could not speak English two years ago，which put him at a disadvantage in America． 他兩年前不會說英語，這使他當時在美國處於不利地位。站開一點；離開一些距離；在遠處
*The picture looks better at a distance．這幅畫遠看更好些。1．confused； puzzled； without any idea迷惑不解；不知所措的
*He was at a loss what to do．他不知所措。
*A good salesman is mever at a loss for words．一個優秀的推銷員總是不會詞窮的。
2．in a state of uncertainty猶豫不決
*She is at a loss whether going out with them or staying at home alone．是同他們一道出去還是一個人留在家裡，她拿不定主意。
3．at a price lower than the original cost虧本的
*He sold his house at a loss．他虧本出售他的房子。
*It can only sell at a loss．這東西只能虧本出售。on each occasion一次
*They learn 30 words and a passage at a time．他們一次學30個單詞和一篇短文。
*He checked them off one at a time as they came in．當他們進來時，他對他們逐個檢查。immediately立刻
*The doctor must be sent for at a word．必須馬上去請醫生。1．in any way； thoroughly全然地；在各方面
*I don't agree with you at all．我完全不同意你的看法。
*There was nothing to worry about at all．完全沒有什麼可擔心的。
2．in the least；to the least extent or degree任何；最輕程度地
*Do you feel ill at all？你感到有任何不適嗎？
3．for any reason究竟
*Do you know at all？你究竟知道不知道？at any cost； regardless of obstacles 無論如何；不顧一切
*He will attain his goal at all costs．他將不惜一切代價達到目的。certainly； in any case一定；無論如何
*At all events I'll go to see her someday．有朝一日，我無論如何會去看她的。
*It may rain tomorrow，but we are going home at all events．明天可能下雨，但無論如何我們還是要回家。at any risk甘冒一切危險
*They have to explode the bridge at all risks．他們必須冒一切危險炸掉那座橋。whatever it may cost無論代價如何
*He won't sell these books at any price．無論給多少錢他都不會把這些書賣掉。in any case； whatever happens無論怎樣；無論如何
*At any rate we'll leave when it stops raining．無論如何，雨停了我們就要動身。
*It isn't much of a car， but at any rate it was not expensive．這不是一輛很好的車，但不管怎樣它很便宜。at bat
