*The money de posited in this bank is at call．存在這家銀行裡的錢可以隨時支取。
*The taxi is at call．出租車隨叫隨到。1．without worry or nervousness；comfortable安適；自在；自如
*His mind was never at ease from the first day he got married．從結婚的第一天起，他心裡就沒有平靜過。
*After the doctor's visit， the patient felt more at ease．經醫生出診看過後，病人感覺舒服多了。
