<<可數名詞>>
1 後面
2 秘密 [不正當] 手段
get in by [through] the back door 
用不正當手段獲得當選1．descend backwards背朝後下降
*He backed down carefully，while I held the ladder for him．我給他扶梯子，他小心地爬下來。
*The car at the top of the slope backed slowly down．坡頂上的那輛汽車慢慢地退下來。
2．give away；yield放棄；讓步
*He backed down and accepted our proposal．他放棄了原有想法，接受了我們的建議。
*The trade union expects the management to back down． 工會希望資方能夠讓步。
*He was too proud to back down and admit mistakes．他傲氣十足，不肯讓步和承認錯誤。back end
