『主英』內陸; 偏遠地區; (尤指) 澳洲內陸back order
(現貨告罄,來日交貨的) 延期交貨單1．withdraw from an agreement or contract撤回協議或契約；退出
*If you back out from the contract，you will have to pay a large sum of money to the company．如果你違背協議，就得向公司支付一大筆錢。
*She backed out of her engagement．她不履行婚約。
2．fail to fulfil sth． such as a promise or obligation食言；收回承擔的責任
*He agreed to lend me the money，but backed out later．他答應借錢給我的，可是後來變卦了。
*At the last minute， John backed out and refused to go with us．最後一分鐘時，約翰變卦了，不同意和我們一起去。
*He backed out because there was not much profit in this undertaking．由於這項事業效益不大，他中途退出了。back page
