2．allow sth． to be sold or lost（at a low price）for sth．of little vaLue； lose through bargaining為獲取某物廉價出售；通過討價還價而失掉
*It was foolish of them to bargain away a vast area of their territory for a sum of money．為了一筆錢，他們竟輕易地放棄了大片領土，真是太蠢了。
*He bargained away his property．他賤賣了自己的財產。
*They have bargained away all hope of success．他們因討價還價而喪失了所有成功的希望。bargain centre
