<<名詞>>
= lesser panda1．weigh heavily upon負重 ；壓垮
*The heavy load seemed to bear the old man down．這重擔似乎要把老人壓垮了。
*This responsibility bears down on him．這個責任沉重地壓在他的肩上。
2．defeat戰勝；擊敗
*His determined efforts at last bore down all his opponents．他堅韌不拔，終於戰勝了所有對手。
3．strive harder； intensify one's effort加緊努力
*She is bearing down in her studies to win a scholarship．為了獲得獎學金，她正發奮學習。
*The driver bore down with all his strength to control the car when the wheels slipped．當輪子打滑時，司機竭盡全力去控制住汽車。
*We must bear down to keep our unbeaten record intact．我們必須努力保持不敗的記錄。bear garden
