bear [take] the ~ for 
?代…受指責; 對…承擔責任
lay [put, place] the ~ (for 
?) on a person將 (…之) 罪推到某人身上place the guilt for（sih．wrong）on （sb．）；lay the blame on把責任推到（某人）身上
