<<可數名詞>>
疔,癤1．be reduced by boiling煮濃
*These apples will soon boil down to jelly．這些蘋果不久就會煮成果醬了。
2．be reduced to its real meaning；mean；summarise意味著；歸結為；使縮短
*You can boil down the story to a few sentences．你可以用幾句話來概括這個故事。
*What the foreign minister said boiled down to the rejection of the proposal．外交部長的話意味著拒絕這項建議。
*The whole discussion boils down to the question of whether the government should fix prices．整個討論歸結到政府是否應當規定價格。overflow by boiling煮沸溢出
