他在往機場途中順道到朋友家訪問
call do1．pay a visit to（a place）拜訪（某場所）
*We called at our new，neighbor's house last week．我們上周去新來的鄰居家裡拜訪。
2．（of a ship）stop for a short time at（船）短暫停靠
*The train calls at every station．這列火車每站都停。1．make return 召回；使…回
*He was called back from his holiday to handle the problem．他從度假中被召回來處理這個問題。
2．remember 記起
*I can't call his name back．我記不起他的名字了。
3．phone back 回電話
*I'll call you back when I get more information．一旦我得到更多的情況，我就給你回電話。call bell
