*We must clear away such ideas among ourselves．我們必須消除我們中間的這些想法。
*The police cleared the crowd away．警察把人群驅散了。
*Please clear away the dinner things．請把餐具撤去。remove；overcome清除；消除
*Let's clear the pavement of snow．咱們把人行道上的積雪清除掉。
*He is now clear of all business difficulties．他現在已掃清了生意中的一切障礙。
*They tried to clear him of his suspicion．他們設法消除他的疑心。1．disappear消散
*The mist cleared off when the sun rose．太陽升起來後霧氣就消散了。
2．pay completely還清債務
*I am glad to have cleared off all the debts．還清了債務，我很高興。
3．remove；dispose of 清理；處理
*The shop decided to clear off the summer clothes when the winter fashions arrived．冬令時裝上市時，商店決定把夏季服裝處理掉。
*Please clear the books off the table．請把書從桌上拿開。
*Clear off the things in this cupboard，please．請把碗櫥裡的東西清理出去。
4．finish完成
*He must clear off the work before he goes on a holiday．他去度假前必須把工作完成。
5．grow bright放晴
*The sky will clear off in the afternoon．下午天會放晴的。
6．leave；go away走開；離開
*I am busy；clear off quickly．我很忙，快走開。
*When the police appeared，the thieves cleared off．警察來時，那些小偷溜走了。1．get rid of處理掉
*When are you going to clear all that rubbish out of the green house？你們準備什麼時候把所有的垃圾從溫室中清理出去？
*He has cleared out all the rat holes around the house．他把房子周圍的鼠洞都清除掉了。
2．leave離開；出港
*The ship cleared out at midnight．那條船是在午夜起航的。
*The man cleared out without paying his room rent．那個人沒有付房錢就離開了。
*The thieves took the jewels and then cleared out．竊賊搶了珠寶後逃之夭夭。clear text
(電報之) 明碼電文1．improve or brighten；become clear轉晴
*I hope it will clear up tomorrow．我希望明天天能放晴。
2．find an answer to；make plain 解釋；使明白；消除（誤會、疑慮等）
*The scientists have been trying to clear up the mystery．科學家們一直試圖揭開這個謎。
*The teacher cleared up the harder parts of the passage．老師解釋了文章中較難的部分。
*The police hope to clear the matter up quickly．警察希望迅速查清這件事情。
3．tidy up；collect together and carry away（rubbish，etc．）整理；集中並運走（垃圾）
*I spent nearly an hour clearing up the room after the children's party．孩子們的晚會結束後，我花了近一個小時整理房間。
*After the fete is over all the litter will have to be cleared up．在遊園會結束後，一定要清理掉那些亂丟的廢物。
4．cure治好
*The pills cleared up his stomach trouble．藥丸治好了他的胃病。
*The medicine will soon clear up your bad cold．這藥很快就會治好你的重感冒。
5．solve；finish解決；完成工作
*The difficulty has been cleared up．困難已經解決了。
*Now that the matter has been cleared up we can go on to consider the next point．既然那個問題已經解決，我們可以接著考慮下一步了。
*I've lots of work to clear up by the weekend．週末前我有大量工作要完成。clear-cut
