<<名詞>>
= close shave1．very near在…附近；接近
*There is a swimming pool close to my house．我家附近有個游泳池。
2．almost幾乎
*She is close to tears．她幾乎哭了。
*The boy came close to falling off the high wall．那孩子差點從高牆上掉下來。1．block or shut；seal堵住；封住
*The opening in the wall has now been closed up．牆上的洞被堵住了。
*We must close up the old well．It's too dangerous．我們必須把這口舊井封起來，它太危險了。
2．heal up；close completely癒合
*Don't worry．Your wound is closing up nicely．不要擔心，你的傷口癒合得很好。
*This kind of ointment will help to close up your burns．這種藥膏會有助於你燒傷傷口的癒合。
3．shut up停業；關閉
*Business declined to such an extent that the store closed up last month．生意清淡到這個地步，那家商店上個月只好關門大吉。
*The shop is closing up．I must ask you to leave．商店就要關門了，我只好請你們離開。
4．come or bring closer together in a line or lines把隊伍靠緊
*The sergeant told the men to close up their ranks．軍士命令士兵把隊伍排緊些。close-at-hand
