*We can compare her poetry to the greatest poems of the presend century．我們可以把她的詩同本世紀最偉大的詩篇相提並論。examine to find things that are the same or different比較（異或同）；同類之間進行具體的比較；對照
*He can not be compared with Shakespeare as a writer of tragedies．作為一個悲劇作家，他無法和莎士比亞相比。
*You can compare your writing with the model writing on page 85．你可以把自己的作文同第85頁的範文作一比較。
*If you compare this with that，you'll find they are very much alike．如果把這個與那個比較一下，你會發現它們非常相似。com.par.i.son
