*The researches are concerned with alpha rays．這些研究都是關於阿爾法射線的。
2．giving one's attention to；worrying about關心；擔心；憂慮
*We must be concerned with the people's wellbeing．我們必須關心群眾生活。
*She is deeply concerned with our health problem．她非常關心我們的健康問題。con.cern.ed.ly
