<<及物動詞>>
(古)= compare
(略作 cf.)1．talk together，esp．to try to reach agreement商討
*They are conferring on the question of reducing prices．他們正在就降低物價的問題進行磋商。
*They conferred on the best way of paying off the debt quickly．他們商議迅速償還債務的最好辦法。
2．bestow授予
*The Queen conferred a title on the brave sailor．女王為那個勇敢的水手授銜。
*The university conferred on him the title of LLD．該大學授予他法學博士稱號。con.fer.ee
