3 [向報館、雜誌社等] 投稿[to]
~ to a newspaper 
向報館投稿1．give（money or time）to；supply（written materials）to 捐（款）；把（時間）投入；投（稿）
*It is an honour to be invited to contribute to your literature magazine．能應邀為你們的文學雜誌寫稿我感到非常榮幸。
*He offered to contribute to the Red Cross．他主動向紅十字會捐款。
2．help to bring about；have a share in 貢獻；有助於
*All these factors contributed to his success．所有這些因素促使他成功了。
*Fresh air and exercise can contribute to good health．新鮮空氣和運動有助於健康。
*This conference will contribute to the cause of opposing hegemonism．這次會議將有助於反霸事業。con.tri.bu.tion
