<<名詞>>
~.ness1．become cool 變冷
*The soup has cooled down．湯涼了。
2．become calmer or less excited冷靜下來
*I won't talk to her until she has cooled down．她冷靜下來我才會同她談。
*The situation has cooled down a lot since yesterday．形勢從昨天起已平靜了許多。
*He cooled the situation down by offering mediation between the disputing parties．他主動提出在爭執雙方斡旋，從而使形勢緩和。
3．become less attracted or enthusiastic 對…冷淡（尤用於比喻）
*Their friendship seems to have cooled down．他們的友誼似乎已經冷淡了。
*His affection for her gradually cooled down．他對她的愛情逐漸冷淡了。cool jazz
