<<可數名詞>>
(尤指家畜的) 母獸
(cf. sire)1．seal with a dam；hold back by means of a dam 築壩攔水
*They have dammed up the valley and built a reservoir．他們已經在山谷裡築了壩，建造了水庫。
2．hold back；restrain（a feeling，etc．）抑制（感情等）
*She not only did her best to dam up her sorrows，but went in for her work even more energetically than ever before．她不僅竭力抑制內心的悲痛，而且以更加充沛的精力投入了工作。
*He dammed up his fury until he could no longer remain silent．他一直到忍無可忍時才大發雷霆。
*We should do our best to dam up inflation．我們應盡一切努力來制止通貨膨漲。dam.age
