[from]
These English words ~ from Greek. 
這些英文字起源於希臘文1．get from 從…得到
*We derive happiness from good health．有健康的身體就能得到幸福。
*She derives great pleasure from reading．她從閱讀中得到許多樂趣。
*I can't find any substitutes for the personal satisfaction derived from work．我從工作中得到的自我滿足是無法用其它東西來替代的。
*We can derive the meaning from the context．我們能從上下文推出含意。
2．have its origin in；come from起源於；出自
*The word「grammar」is derived from ancient Greek．英語「grammar」這個詞源於古希臘文。
