大肉盤中剩下來的肉汁1．serve out in a dish or dishes用盤上菜
*She is busy dishing out food to the guests．她正忙著給客人們端飯菜。
2．distribute； provide分配；提供
*The government dishes out payments to people without jobs．政府給失業的人發錢。
*The teacher dished out the new books to the students in class．老師在課堂上給學生發新書。
*The corrupt politician dished out titles and honours to his friends and supporters，many of whom were quite undeserving．那個腐敗的政客給他的朋友和支持者封官許願，他們當中有許多人根本就不配。dish ring
