我要抄寫幾份呢?
We asked her to do us a translation. = We asked her to do a translation forus. 
我們要求她替我們翻譯
4 a. 烹調<肉等>; 做<菜>
(cf. well-done 1,overdone,underdone) 
They do fish very well here. 
這一家燒的魚很好吃
b. 把<肉等>烹調<成…>
