2．listen with attention to全神貫注地傾聽
*The boy drank in every word of the sailor's story of his adventures．這男孩全神貫注地傾聽那水手講的冒險故事的每一句話。
*Whenever there's any gossip in the neighbourhood，Mrs Green drinks it all in and spreads it as fast as she can．無論什麼時候，只要街坊四鄰有什麼閒話，格林太太總是全神貫注地聽著，然後又盡可能快地張揚出去。
3．take pleasure in giving one's attention to（e．g．a sight）陶醉於；欣賞（景色等）
*We stood on top of the hill， drinking in the beautiful view．我們站在小山之巔，欣賞這美麗的景色。
