付帳日期; 付款日期1．caused by；because of；owing to；thanks to由於；因為；由…造成
*The accident was due to careless driving．這場車禍是粗心駕駛造成的。
*What would you say inflation is mainly due to？你認為通貨膨脹的主要原因是什麼？
*He arrived late due to the storm．他由於暴風雨而來遲了。
2．attributable to歸於
*His success was largely due to his hard work．他的成功在很大程度上歸功於他的辛勤勞動。
*The credit is due to you．榮譽應該歸於你。
*Respect is die to older people．年長者應受到尊敬。
*The first place is due to the chairman．首席應給主席。
*What is the amount due to you？欠你多少錢？
3．expected or scheduled to arrive or be ready；supposed to do 預期的；應到的；預定的
*The train is due to pull in at 5：30a.m.火車預定早上5點半到達。
*Professor Smith is due to give us a lecture at eight tomorrow morning．史密斯教授預定明天上午8點給我們演講。du.el
