(置於沙發等旁的小桌子)1．reach a final situation；die ；be killed 終結；死；被殺死
*The gangster ended up in the electric chair．那個歹徒最後被送上電椅處死。
*The runaway prisoner ended up in a river．那個逃犯最後死在一條河裡。
2．come to an end；finish by 結束；以…結束
*If you don't slow down，you'll end up in hospital.你要是不減速，你會被送進醫院的。
*She ended up her speech with a short poem．她朗誦了一首短詩結束了她的演講。
*Despite his strenuous efforts，he ended up unsuccessfully after all．儘管他付出了艱苦的努力，可最後還是沒有成功。end use
