fade up
= FADE in1. become gradually fainter；disappear slowly；lose one's strength逐漸減弱；慢慢消失；衰弱
*The sound of cheering faded away in the distance．歡呼聲在遠處漸漸消失了。
*They watched the airplane fading away into the mist．他們看著飛機消失在雲霧中。
*She became ill and slowly faded away．她生了病，身體便慢慢地衰弱下去。
*The old man is just fading away.那個老人的身體在漸漸衰弱。
2．retreat or vanish quietly 悄悄地離開 He faded away quietly and we never saw him again．他悄悄地溜掉了，我們再也沒有看到他。
*He is an expert at fading away away when he isn't needed．他很善於在不需要他的時候悄悄地走開。fade-in
