3 
a. <頭髮、衣服等> 垂在[…] [over,down] ; 垂下[到…][to]; [從…]垂下[from]
Her veil fell over her shoulders. 
她的面紗垂在肩上
with her hair ~ing down her back 
她頭髮垂背
The curtain ~s to the floor. 
窗簾垂到地上
