農場經營1．send away to be done；rent out請他人代勞；招人承包；出租
*Our teacher had too many test papers to read，so she farmed out half of them to a friend．我們老師須批改的試卷太多，所以她分出一半請朋友幫忙批閱。
*The work has been farmed out to various people．這個活兒包給了許多人。
*Landlords in old China farmed out their land to their tenants and lived in luxury off the rents．在舊中國地主把土地出租給佃農，靠收租過著奢侈的生活。
*They may farm out production of the machine parts to other factories．他們可以讓別的工廠承包一些機器零件的生產。
2．send away to be taken care of送請他人照料
*While mother was sick，the children were farmed out to relatives．在母親生病期間，孩子們被送請親戚照顧。
*The woman was kind to those children who were farmed out to her．那女人對寄養在她家的孩子關懷備至。
3．send a player to a league where the quality of play is lower把球員送到水平較低的球隊去鍛煉
*The player was farmed out to Rochester to gain experience．這個隊員被派到羅徹斯特隊以獲取比賽經驗。
4．exhausted for farming 地力耗盡
*This land has been farmed out．這塊地（因種植過多）地力已耗盡。farm produce
