製造家畜飼料的工廠1．eat one's food from（a place，a dish，etc．）從…取得食物
*The guests sat crosslegged around a low table and fed off a big plate．客人們圍著一張矮桌子盤腿而坐，吃大盤子裡的東西。
*The pigs fed off the same trough．這些豬在一個食槽裡吃食。
2．use as a source or supplier of food， materials，energy，etc．以…為食物、材料、能量等的來源
*These little bears feed off the leaves of this special tree．這些小熊以這種特殊的樹葉為食。
*When fresh food and water are not available，the camel can feed off its hum．當得不到新鮮食物和水時，駱駝能以駝峰為養料的來源。
*To avoid a power cut，they decided to feed off an alternative generator．為了防止停電，他們決定靠備用發電機發電。
*Some bigger newspapers feed off reports in smaller papers．一些大報常採用小報的新聞報道。1．live on； take as food以…為食物
*Cattle feed chiefly on grass．牛主要以草為食。
*What do you feed your dog on？你用什麼餵你的狗？
*We feed our dogs on fresh meat．我們用新鮮的肉餵狗。
*He is out of employment and feeds on a friend．他失業了，靠朋友生活。
2．become nourished，satisfied or strengthened from；consume or utilize from從…得到供養、滿足、增強；以…為能源
*His convictions feed on determination．由於有了決心，他的信心增強了。
*The eye feeds on beautiful objects．美景悅目。
*The gas turbine feeds on the fuel it pumps．燃氣輪機以它抽入的燃料為能源。feed pipe
