<<名詞>>
1 『主英』活人的魂; 離魂
2 相同物fetch candle
=fetch lightfetch light
鬼火1．eventually arrive（in a place）到達
*We all fetched up simultaneously at the same spot．我們是在同時到達同一地點的。
*When did you fetch up in Nanjing？你是什麼時候到達南京的？
2．come to a halt突然停止
*The car suddenly fetched up in front of our building．那輛車突然在我們樓前停了下來。
*He was fetched up short by the red light．他突然被紅燈擋住停下。
3．make up（lost time，etc．）彌補（失去的時間等）
*I have been playing for two days in the week； I'll redouble my efforts to fetch up the lost time．本周我已經玩了兩天，我將加倍努力把失去的時間補上。
4．vomit嘔吐
*He's very unwell and fetches up all he eats．他病得不輕，吃什麼吐什麼。
5． recall回憶
*He often fetches up his interesting life in his childhood．他常常回憶他兒童時代的有趣的生活。
6．raise；bring up撫養；養大
*She fetched up two or phans．她撫養了兩個孤兒。fetch.ing
