That figures
(口語)那當然,有道理figure eight
1 8 字飛行路線
(飛機飛行表演)
2 8 字行溜冰
(花式溜冰者單足表演)
3 任何具有 8 字形的形式,表象
(如 8 字形蝴蝶結)1．depend on；count on依賴；指望
*Don't figure on the weather being fine for your garden party．不要指望花園聚會有好天氣。
*I was figuring on your support．我指望你的支持。
*We can figure on him to be on time．我們能指望他按時來。
2．expect打算；期待；估計
*If you figure on success，you stand a better chance of winning．如果你想成功，你就有了取勝的較大可能。
*We figured on his coming and he came．我們估計他要來，他真來了。
*It was something we had not figured on．這是我們料想不到的事。
*We did not figure on having so many people at the picnic．我們沒有料到會有這麼多人參加野餐。1．calculate；work out；estimate 計算（出）；估計
*It would be difficult to figure out the losses at this time．目前很難對損失作出估計。
*I can't figure out how much money I owe them．我算不出欠他們多少錢。
*I have figured out most carefully the time and the materials needed to complete the job．我已經很仔細地算出了完成這項工作所需的時間和材料。
*He couldn't figure out the last problem on the arithmetic test．他解不出算術考試卷上的最後一道題。
2．understand with difficulty理解
*I couldn't figure out what he was hinting at．我不理解他的用意何在。
*It's difficult to figure out why she said those things at the meeting．很難理解她為什麼要在會上講那些事情。
*Have you figured out how to succeed without trying？你有沒有想出怎樣才能不試而能成功？
*I wish I could figure out how their 168minds work．我要是能摸透他們的心事就好了。figure painting
