c. 裝滿<東西> <給某人> ,倒滿; 裝滿<東西>[給某人][for]
He ~ed me a glass of whiskey. = He ~ed a glass of whiskey for me. 
他倒滿一杯威士忌酒給我
d. [用…]裝滿<容器等>給<某人>[with]; [替某人] 將<容器等>裝滿[…][for][with]
Please ~ me this glass with water. = Please ~ this glass with water for me. 
