突發而猛烈的火災flash flood
驟發山洪move briefly to a later point in a story提前敘述故事情節
*The film flashed forward to the death of the soldiers．電影提前表現了戰士們的犧牲。a person or thing that starts out well but does not continue 曇花一現的人物；虎頭蛇尾；短暫的成功
*Mary got 100 on the first test in arithmetic but it was just a flash in the pan because she later failed several times in arithmetic．瑪麗第一次算術考試得了100分，但只是曇花一現，因為後來幾次算術考試都不及格。
*They won the first match，but it was only a flash in the pan，they lost all the other games．他們贏了第1場比賽，可是好景不長，後面幾場比賽全輸了。
*He was indeed popular for a short time， but he didn't last long， just a flash in the pan．他的確紅了一陣子，但好景不長，只不過是曇花一現而已。flash lamp
