*The dog has a vicious temper ； you had better not fool with him．那條狗脾氣很壞，你最好不要亂逗它。
*The boy was hurt while fooling with a loaded gun．那男孩子是在擺弄一支裝有子彈的槍時受傷的。
2．contend or fight without serious intent with；toy with不認真地和…競爭或鬥爭；和…戲耍
