*Children should give an ear to their parents'advice．小孩應該聽從父母的勸告。make sth．seem true or likely（加以渲染）使某事可信、生動
*The illustrations he used helped to give colour to his lecture．他採用的圖解使他的演講大為生動。
*The boy's torn clothes gave color to his story of a fight．這孩子的衣服被撕破，這更使人相信他跟別人打架的故事了。give.away
