*I'm afraid that I will have to go back on my word for I am now hopelessly ill in bed．恐怕我要食言了，因為我現在重病在床。turn sour；start to decay變質；變壞
*Don't drink this milk；it's gone bad．不要喝這個牛奶，它變質了。1．search for尋究；推敲
