*He was afraid his father would go into orbit when he found out about his failure in the examination again．他擔心父親發現他考試又不及格會暴跳如雷。1．make a sudden ringing noise爆發突然的響聲
*A bomb went off in the theater．一顆炸彈在劇院裡爆炸了。
