*The party went off without any trouble．聚會順利進行，沒有任何麻煩。
She had the operation this morning and it all went off quite well．她今天上午動了手術，一切很順利。1．travel旅行
*I'd like to go on a long triP away from these troubles．我要去作一次很遠的旅行，以擺脫這些煩惱。
