*He told us what had been going on．他告訴我們發生了什麼事。
9．begin to receive；get help from 開始領取；得到救濟
*A lot of people who never expected to be unemployed have to go on the dole．許多從來沒有料到會失業的人現在只好靠領取救濟金過日子了。
