*Because of depression，many big factories had to go on to short time or stop production altogether．由於經濟不景氣，許多大工廠不得不減少工時，甚至完全停產。go or act as one wants to獨自行動；一意孤行
*It's no use arguing with him，for he will go his own way instead of changing his mind．和他爭論沒用，因為他將一意孤行，不會改變主意。
