*The actor had to go over his lines many times before he got them right．這位演員要把台詞重複好多遍才能背熟。
4．clean or repair擦洗或修理I've asked the garage people to go over my car thoroughly before I start my long journey．在開始我的長途旅行之前，我請車庫工人徹底擦拭保養我的車。
5．touch up；improve潤色；改進
