*They set sail at dawn and headed for the United States．他們的船在黎明時啟程駛向美國。
*You are heading for an accident if you drive after drinking．你酒後駕車是要出車禍的。
*He is heading for trouble if he goes on behaving like that．要是他繼續那樣胡來，他是自找麻煩。
