*He helped himself freely to the furniture of the house．他隨便地使用房間裡的家俱。help in doing or getting；assist as much as possible；help sb．out of a difficulty幫忙；盡力協助；幫助克服困難
*There was only a young girl to help out in the kitchen．廚房裡只有一個年輕的女孩在幫忙。
