*His actions are not in accord with his words．他言行不一。1.in conformity with同…一致
*This is in accordance with reason．這是合乎情理的。
*His words are not in accordance with common sense．他的話不符合常識。
2. according to根據
*He did not act in accordance with the orders．他沒有遵照命令辦事。
*This is done in accordance with the instructions of the principal.這是依照校長指示做的。besides除…之外
*In addition to English， he has to study a second foreign language．除英語外，他還得學門第2外語。
*In addition to a large collection of scientific works in Chinese，our library contains many scientific books in foreign languages．我們圖書館除了藏有大批中文科技書籍之外，還有許多外文科技書籍。beforehand事先；預先
*Please pay five yuan in advance.請預付人民幣5元。
*She received one month's salary in advance.她預支了一個月的工 資。
*He registered for the examination well in advance．他早就報名應試 了。
*The factory fulfilled the state production plan one month in advance．這個工廠提前一個月完成國家生 產計劃。1. in front of在…前面
*He came well in advance of the rest of the group．他來的比組裡 其他人早得多。
*She walked in advance of her husband．她走在她丈夫前面。
2． superior to；further developed 優於；較…進步
*In some respects we are far in advance of our neighbouring countries．在某些方面，我們比鄰國進步得多。
*Galileo's ideas were in advance of  the age in which he lived．伽利略 的想法超越了他所生活的時代。in ae.ter.num
