*Please write your name in full．請把你的全名寫出來。
*Please describe the matter in full．請把事情詳細說說。
*They accomplished the task in full．他們圓滿地完成了這項任務
*His speech was published in full in all the papers yesterday．昨天各家報紙全文刊登了他的講話。at the maximum point of activity 緊張（積極）進行
*The negotiations are in full swing．談判正在緊張地進行。
*When he arrived，the meeting was already in full swing．當他到那裡的時候，會議正開得很熱烈。
*A mass campaign to plant trees is in full swing．一場群眾性植樹運動正在轟轟烈烈地進行。as a joke；playfully；not seriously 開玩笑的；非認真的
*I said it only in fun．我說這話不過是開玩笑的。
*Don't be angry；I only said so for fun．請不要生氣，我這樣說只是為了開個玩笑。in fu.tu.ro
