[In`kwaIr; inˋkwaiŋ]
《源自拉丁文「尋求」的意思》<<及物動詞>>
1 a. 問,詢問
I will ~ his name. 
我要詢問他的名字
b. 詢問
She ~d when the shop would open. 
她詢問那家店何時開門
I will ~ how to get there. 
我要詢問如何才能到達那裡
2 (文語)
a. 問,詢問[人]<某事>[of]
He ~d of the policeman the best way to the station. 
他問警察到車站最便捷的路
b. [向人]詢問…[of]
I ~ed of him whet her he liked it. 
我問他是否喜歡它
<<不及物動詞>>
查問[人][關於…][of][about]
I~ within. 
請參閱本文; 請向店內查詢
I ~ed (of him) about buses to the station. 
我向他查詢到車站的公共汽車
inquire after 
?問候<某人>,向<某人>問安; 慰問<某人>的病
She ~d after your mother. 
她問候你的母親
inquire for?
(1)要求會見<某人>,訪問<某人>
Someone has been inquiring for you. 
有人要求見你
(2)查詢<物品>,需求
I ~d for the book at a bookstore. 
我向書店查詢有沒有那一本書出售
inquire into 
? 調查…
The police ~d into the case. 
警方調查該案try to get information about打聽消息
*Newspaper reporters have been inquiring about the missing child．報紙記者們一直在打聽那位失蹤小孩的下落。
*He wants to inquire about his luggage．他想查問他的行李。ask politely about sb．'s health 問好；問安
*The teacher inquired after your health．老師問起了你的健康情況。
*He asked me to inquire after you．
*他要我問候你。
*He inquired after me with solicitude．他關心地向我問好。1．ask to meet sb．欲見某人
*She inquires for the manager．她要求見經理。
*someone came here to inquire for you today．今天有人來求見你。
2．ask about sb．'s health問候
*My mother asked me to inquire for you．我母親要我問候你。
3．ask 問
*He inquired for the way to the station．他問到車站去的路。
4．ask for 要；尋求
*She is inquiring for a copy of English grammar．她要一本英語語法書。try to discover the fact of調查
*The police are inquiring into the matter．警察正在調查此事。
*They inquired into the matter rather thoroughly．他們徹底調查了這件事。seek information by questioning向…詢問；探詢
*We inquired the way of a farmer．我們向一農夫問路。in.quir.er
