(特技飛行)1．upside down 翻過來；倒過去；裡在外
*The wind blew Mary's umbrella inside out．風把瑪麗的傘吹得翻過來。
*He was wearing his coat inside out．他把衣服反穿著。
*I turned my trouser pockets inside out but could not find the piece of paper with the address．我把褲子口袋翻過來也沒有找到留有地址的那張條子。
2．perfectly；completely 完全地；徹底地
*He knew his trade inside out．他對他的業務瞭如指掌。
*Since he knows the problem inside out，he has more say on it that I do．他對這個問題瞭解得很清楚，因此，他比我更有發言權。Inside Passage
