2 混合的,混入[…]的,交織的[with]
His thoughts were ~ with his love for her. 
他的想法中夾雜著他對她的愛much sought after大量需要
*The goods are much in demand in winter．這種物品冬季需求量很大。
*Oil is in great demand these days．現在非常需要石油。in the progress of time遲早；終有一日
*If you study hard， you'll learn English well in course of time．如果你努力學習，最終你一定能掌握英語。in process of；during the process or progress of正在…之中
*The railway is now in course of construction．那條鐵路正在建造之中。
*He happened，in course of conversation，to say that he had the intention of visiting China．在談話中，他碰巧提到他有意訪問中國。1． confronted by面對
*He never shows any fear in face of danger．在危險面前他從不畏懼。
*What could he do in face of all these difficulties？面對這些困難，他能幹什麼呢？
2．in opposition to；in spite of反對；不顧
*Talking continued even in the face of the teacher's command to stop．縱然老師已下令停止談話，但有人還是講個不停。
*He succeeded in the face of all difficulties．儘管困難重重，他還是成功了。1． because of由於；因為
*In light of the muddy field， the football team put on their rubbers．因為道路泥濘，足球隊員都穿上了膠鞋。
2．according to；as a result of （new information）； by means of （new idea）依據；根據
*It is to be regarded as excusable in the light of circumstance．考慮到具體情況，這將被看作是可以原諒的。
*The teacher changed John's grade in the light of the extra work in his exercise book．老師根據他作業本裡所做的額外作業而更改了他的成績。instead of代替…；…而不…
*We use chopsticks in place of knives and forks．我們用筷子代替刀叉。
*I attended the meeting in place of John because he was sick．約翰生病了，所以我代替他出席了那次會議。in the course of在…過程中
*The street is in（the）process of repair．這條街正在翻修中。I.o
