騙取某人的錢
2 [~ oneself 或 ~ one's way] 用說謊[從…]逃脫,用說謊擺脫…[out of]
He ~d himself [his way] out of the trouble. 
他說謊擺脫了麻煩
lie in one's teeth [throat] 
撒大謊1．lie unused or unwanted 擱置不用
*That old book was lying about for years before I finally threw it away．那本舊書擱放了好幾年不用，最後我把它扔掉了。
2．be thrown about 到處亂放；亂撒
*Don't leave your clothes lying about the room．不要把衣服亂扔在房間裡。
3．lie idly doing nothing 閒躺著不幹事
*Don't lie about all day．別整天躺著啥事也不幹。1．get into or be in a lying position 躺下
*Lie back，and you'll be more comfortable．向後靠，這樣你會舒服些。
*She lay back in bed．她仰著躺在床上。
2．stop working；rest 停止忙碌；休息
*After a busy life he was content to lie back and take it easy．經過一生忙碌的生涯後，他對能休息下來享受清閒的生活而感到滿足。1．be the cause of；be the explanation for 是…理由
*I'm not sure what lay behind his remarks．我不清楚他說這樣的話的原因是什麼。
2．have happened to；be in the past 先於…存在；已成過去
*Some difficulties lie behind us，but greater ones lie ahead．有些困難已經過去，而更大的困難還在前面。
*Behind lay nothing but defeat；ahead lay the certainty of victory．回顧過去，只有失敗；展望未來，勝利在望。lie detector
<<可數名詞>>
(口語)測謊器
give a person a ~ test 
對某人作測謊試驗1．recline 躺下
*You had better go and lie down．你還是去躺一下好。
2．go to rest；sleep；wait 休息；睡覺；等候
*I lay down for an hour．我躺下休息了一個小時。
*Let me lie down；I am very tired．讓我休息，我很疲倦。
3．fail in response to obligations；prove disappointing；purposely fail to do one's job 令人失望；有意失職；偷懶
*He lay down on me．他令我失望。
*If you lie down on your job，you will lose it．你如果故意偷懶，就會失業。
*Bell isn't trying to learn his lessons．He is lying down on the job．比爾不想學習，他是有意偷懶。
4．submit tamely；accept 馴服；接受；忍受
*He lay down like a coward．他像懦夫一樣地屈服了。
*I hope you don't expect me just to lie down and take his insults．我想你不會要我容忍他的污辱的。
*The men will not lie down under such treatment．工人們不會逆來順受這種待遇。1．be in the power of 在…能力以內
*I have done everything that lies in my power．我已盡了最大努力。
2．centre in；exist in；be found in 集中於；在於；存在於
*All their hopes lie in him．他們把一切希望都寄托在他身上。
*The chief difficulty lies in finding a good opportunity．主要困難在於找到一個好時機。
*The trouble lies in the engine．毛病出在發動機上。
*His chief attraction lies in his character，not his looks．他的魅力在於他的性格，而不是外貌。
*The fundamental way out for agriculture lies in mechanization．農業的根本出路在於機械化。
3．stay in bed to await the birth of a child 分娩
*She is lying in．她正在分娩。
*The time has come for her to lie in．她生產的時候已經到了。
4．stay in bed after the normal time for getting up 睡懶覺
*You ought to lie in tomorrow and catch up on your sleep．你明天應當晚起，把你所缺的覺補上。
*She never lies in，even on Sunday mornings．她從不睡懶覺，即使星期天早上也如此。1．keep a little away from the shore；rest nearby 與陸地保持一段距離；在附近停泊
*The ship is now lying off，ready to load up．現在這艘船在附近停泊，等待裝貨。
2．cease work for a time 歇工；暫停工作
*As soon as he makes a little money，he lies off and spends it．他掙一點錢就不幹活，將其花盡。
*The men had to lie off for a week as the rain made building impossible．大雨使建築工程無法進行，工人們只好暫時歇工一星期。1．be a matter of obligation or duty為…義務或職責
*It lies upon him to support his family．贍養家庭是他的責任。
*The whole responsibility lies upon me．全部責任落在我的身上。
2．depend on 依賴
*Your success lies upon your effort．你的成功歸於你的努力。
*Her life lies on the result of this operation．她的生命取決於這次手術的結果。
3．bear as a burden 壓在
*The crime lay heavy on his conscience．那罪行成為他良心上的沉重負擔。1．be postponed for action at some future time；be left waiting until a later time 推遲；延期；待以後處理
*Let the matter lie over until the next committee meeting．這件事留到下次委員會再討論吧。
*The decision must lie over until the next executive meeting．這項決定必須留到下一次執委會討論再定。
2．（a note，payment，etc．）remain unpaid when overdue（票據、款項等）逾期未付
*You must first pay the rent lying over from last month．你必須首先付清上月欠下的房租。1．stay in bed or in one's room from illness（for a long period）長期躺在床上
*Mother was so ill after her operation that she had to lie up for a month．母親動完手術後病情十分嚴重，不得不在床上躺了一個月。
*The doctor advised me to lie up for a week．醫生建議我休息一周。
*He intends to lie up for a time．他打算休息一段時間。
2．remain in hiding 藏匿
*The criminals are lying up somewhere in those hills．罪犯就藏在那些山裡。
*They lay up by day，and by night came out to attack convoys．他們白天隱藏起來，晚上出來襲擊車隊。
*The police suspect that the escaped convict is lying up in this city．警察懷疑那逃犯可能隱藏在這個城市。
3．be out of use 停止使用
*My car has been lying up all winter．我的車整個冬天都沒有使用。
*His boat is lying up for repairs．他的船正在船塢裡進行檢修。lie-a.bed
