*John got very little pay，and the family lived from hand to mouth when he had no job．約翰薪水本來很少，當他失業以後，日子就更艱難了。live in a place，as an employee or member of an institution在所在單位寄宿
*Servants used to live in，and have their own rooms in their master'shouse．過去傭人通常住在主人家中，而且還有自己的房間。
*Students of this college can live in or get a room in town．這個學院的學生可以住校也可以在城裡找一個房間走讀。live load
[laIv; laiv]
