2．inferior to；ranking second次於；僅次於
*It is the largest city next to London．這是僅次於倫敦的最大都市。
*Next to riding，I like swimming best．除騎馬外，我就最愛游泳了。
3．almost；almost amounting to幾乎是
*No wonder she is ill！She eats next to nothing．難怪她生病！她幾乎什麼也不吃。
