《源自 not 與 one 的混合形; 原為 non (e) ,後來尾部的 n 脫落而成》<<形容詞>>
(無比較級、最高級)
1 
a. (一個) 人 (也) 沒有
N~ man is without his faults. 
沒有人是無過失的
"Is there a book on the table?"- "No, there is no book there.". 
「桌上有一本書嗎?」「沒有,那裡一本也沒有」
No student could solve this problem. 
沒有學生能解答這個問題
b. 一點[個]…也沒有
He has no brothers. 
他一個兄弟也沒有
There are no clouds in the sky. 
天上一片雲也沒有
I have no money on [with] me. 
我身上一點錢也沒有
There is no water on the moon. 
月球上一點水也沒有
c. [there is no ~ing] 絲毫不能 [簡直無法] …
There is no saying what may happen. 
簡直無法知道發生何事
d. 絕不…,根本不…
He is no scholar. 
他根本不是學者
It's no joke. 
這絕不是開玩笑
I am no match for him. 
我絕不是他的對手
This is no place for a boy at night. 
這裡根本不是男孩晚上來 [逗留] 的地方
e. [no+名詞] 沒有…的狀態
No news is good news. 
→ news 1 a
No customers will kill us. 
沒有顧客會使我們 (的生意) 垮掉
2 不可有…,反對,禁止
No militarism!. 
反對軍國主義!
No parking. 
『告示』禁止停車
No smoking. 
『告示』禁煙
No talking in class. 
上課中禁止講話
no one→ no one,noone
no other than[but]=NONE other than[but]
<<副詞>>
1 [對詢問、委託等的回答] 不,否; 
[對否定詢問的回答] 是,不錯
( 
←→ yes) 
"Do you like potatoes?"-"No, I don't.". 
「你喜歡吃馬鈴薯嗎?」「不,我不喜歡」
"Haven't you been to London?"-"No, I never have.". 
「你沒去過倫敦嗎?」「是的,我沒去過」
"You don't want it, do you?"-"No, not at all.". 
「你不想要它,是吧?」「是的,一點也不想要」
2 不,否
One man cannot lift it, no, not (even) [nor] half a dozen. 
一個人不能將它舉起來,對, (即使) 六個人也不行
3 a. 絕不是 [絕非] …
He showed no small skill. 
他展現 [顯示] 了非同小可的本事
The job is no easy one. 
那件工作絕非易事
b. 不是[沒有]… (not) 
I am no good at it. 
我對它不擅長
Our family is no different from the average family. 
我們的家庭和一般家庭沒有什麼不同
c. 一點也不[沒有]… (not at all) 
→ no BETTER than,no LESS than,no MORE than
I can walk no further [farther]. 
我一點也不能再走了,我再也走不動了
She is a little girl no bigger than yourself. 
她是個不比你大的小女孩 [她跟你一樣是個小女孩] 
4 [?or no] (是…或) 不是; (不管…) 與否
I don't know whether or no it's true.= I don't know whether it's true or no. 
我不知道事情是真或假 [是否真實] 
Unpleasant or no, it is true. 
不管愉快與否,那是事實
5 不!不會吧!
No, that's impossible!. 
不,那是不可能的!
No can do. (
口語)不能那樣 [不行] 
<<名詞>>
(pl. noes,~s[z; z])
1「不」 (no) 的回話,否定,否認,拒絕
( 
←→ yes,ay,aye) 
say no 
說「不」,否認
Two noes make a yes. 
兩個否定變成肯定,否定之否定是肯定
He won't take no for an answer. 
他不接受「不」的回答
2 (C)[常 ~es]投反對票 (者) 
( 
←→ aye) 
The noes have it [are in a minority]. 
投反對票者佔多數 [佔少數]almost幾乎是；簡直是
*Her life before liberation was no better than that of a beggar．解放前她的生活同乞丐差不多。
*Although he boasts a lot，he is no better than the others．別看他吹得厲害，其實他並不比別人強。doubtless；without question；certainly無疑；一定
*No doubt Susan was the smartest girl in her class．無疑蘇珊是她班上最聰明的學生。1．very much；exceeding非常
*Jim was no end upset because he couldn't go swimming．吉姆非常著急，因為他不能去游泳。
2．almost without stopping；continually不停；繼續
*The baby cried no end．嬰兒不住地哭。1．so many／much of as to seem almost endless不盡的
*There was no end of letters pouring into the post office．數不盡的信件投到郵局。
*There will be no end of trouble later on if we don't wipe out the insect pests now．現在不根除害蟲，將來後患無窮。
2．especially；very非常地；無比地；特別地
*He thinks no end of himself．他覺得他自己很了不起。not satisfactory；not adequate；notapproved不滿意；不中用；不足；不同意
*He tried appealing to the man's pride，but it did no good．他想討好那個人，但行不通。
*It's no good arguing with him since he is incapable of seeing anyone else's point of view．跟他爭沒用，他不會接受任何人的觀點的。1．as much as正好；至少
*There was no less than thirty dollars in the drawer．抽屜裡少說也有30美元。
2．as many as與…一樣
*This boy is no less clever than that one．這個男孩與那個男孩一樣聰明。not any more不再
*He is no longer living here．他已不住在這裡了。
*Now this great stretch of lowland no longer faces the menace of flood．現在，這一大片窪地已不再受洪水的威脅了。1．regardless of；in spite of無論；不管
*He had to get the car fixed no matter how much it cost．無論花多少錢他都得把車子送去修一下。
*No matter when he comes，I won't see him．無論他什麼時候來，我都不會見他。
*I'll always love you，no matter what happens．無論發生什麼事情，我將永遠愛你。
2．not anything important不重要的
*I wanted to see him before he left，but it's no matter．他離開前我想見他，但這並不很重要。
*It's no matter if the work is not finished today．這工作今天完不成也沒關係。1．not any more；not again不再
*His voice is heard no more．他的聲音再也聽不見了。
*Time lost will return no more．失去的時間不會再來。
2．dead死了；不復存在
*The barren hills are no more；all around there are fruit trees．荒山不見了，到處都是果樹。
*The ancient city Troy is no more．古城特洛伊已不存在了。
*The great leader is no more．這位偉大的領袖已去世了。
3．neither也不；也沒有
*You don't know Spanish，no more does he．你不懂西班牙語，他也不懂。
*He can't afford a new car，and no more can I．他買不起新車，我也買不起。only只有
*There was no more than thirty dollars in the drawer．抽屜裡只有30美元。
*She was no more than an ordinary worker but she has invented a lot of new machines．她只不過是一個普通的工人，然而她卻發明了許多新機器。not at all more than與…相比，同樣也不…
*He is no more diligent than you．你不勤奮，他也不勤奮。
*A student can no more obtain knowledge without studying than a farmer can get harvest without ploughing．學生不學習不能獲得知識，正如農民不耕種就不能收穫一樣。
*One minute late is no more in time than half an hour．遲到一分鐘跟遲到半小時同樣是不準時。no one, noone
