*I'm going of my own free will；no one has ordered me to go．我是自願去的，沒有人命令我。becoming old enough to be responsible in law成年
*In England， both men and women come of age at 21．在英國，無論男女，都以21歲為成年。naturally；certainly當然地
*The rain came pouring down， and of course the sports meet was canceled．大雨瓢潑，運動會當然也就取消了。
*Of course you know that girl；she's in your class．你當然認識那個女孩，因為她在你們班上。automatically自動地
*The door opened of itself．門自動地開了。in the recent past；not long ago近來
*There have been too many high school dropouts of late．近來中途退學的中學生太多了。
*She doesn't seem to be very happy of late．最近她看上去不大開心似的。necessarily ；unavoidably必然地；不可避免地
*With the Spring Festival coming soon， the traffic will of necessity become heavier．隨著春節的到來，運輸必將更加繁忙。
*Being your lawyer，he will of necessity want to know all the details．作為你的律師，他當然要瞭解全部細節。of no importance無關緊要
*This question is of no account．這個問題不重要。useless； unsuccessful； in vain沒有用
*His sickness was treated with many medicines，but all were of no avail．他的病已用各種藥治過，但都無效。
*Tom's practicing was of no avail．He was sick on the day of the game．湯姆平時的練習全部泡湯了，比賽那天他病了。
*Although they tried hard， their efforts seemed to be of no avail．雖說他們花了很大力氣，但看來還是徒勞無功。long ago； in the past古時候；過去
*Knights of old had to wear armor in battle．古代的騎士作戰時都戴盔甲。
*Things are very different now from what they used to be of old．現在的情況跟從前大不一樣了。
*He often recollects days of old．他常常回想起往昔的日子。
*In days of old， Mary's grandfather lived in this village．從前，瑪麗的祖父就住在這個村子裡。of one's own wish； voluntarily出於自願
*On her mother's birthday， Betsy did the housework of her own accord．母親過生日那天，貝茜主動做家務。
*He joined the search party of his own accord．他主動參加了搜索組。not especially good勉強稱得上的；普通的
*Though some people praise his verse， he's really only a poet of sorts．儘管有人稱讚他的詩，實際上他只是一個蹩腳的詩人。
*Tom was a magician of sorts but popular at parties．湯姆算不上是個好魔術師，但在聚會時很受歡迎。of the finest quality； superior最好的；第一流的
*He was no doubt a painter of the first water．他無疑是位一流的畫家。
*The jeweler chose diamonds of the first water for the queen's crown．珠寶商為王后的冠飾挑選頭等鑽石。useful有用的
*This book will be of some use to you in future．這本書將來對你會有用的。OF, O.F.
