*He bought the watch on his own account，not for his brother．這表不是給他兄弟買的，而是為他自己買的。
2． independently獨立地
*It's too dangerous； I dare not do it on my own account．這太危險了，我不敢獨自一人擔這個風險。alert；ready to act機警；準備去做
