*I'll buy some apples on my way home．在回家的路上我要買些蘋果。requested but ont yet supplied 訂購中 The shop assistant told the customer that they didn't have this type of shoes in stock then， and that they were on order．售貨員告訴顧客他們店現在這種鞋已沒貨了，正在訂購中。
