*I'm glad you want to talk about this． It's been on my mind for weeks．我很高興你要談論這件事。我已想了好幾個星期了。as far as…concerned就…而言
*The other team blamed their defeat on unfairness on the part of the referee．另一支球隊把他們的失敗歸咎於裁判的不公正。in sb．'s care；as sb．'s responsibility歸某人管；為某人的責任
*The success of the program rests on your shoulders．此項計劃的成功就取決於你了。punctual； at the expected time在預定的時間
