*The success of the operation on his legs opened the door to a whole new life for him．他腿部手術的成功給他帶來了新生活的希望。
*This agreement opens the door to advances in every field．這個協議為各方面的發展創造了條件。
*Higher education opens the door to a better jobs．高等教育為尋求較好職業創造了條件。liable to易接受…的
