*Do what I tell you，or else you'll be sorry．照我的話做，否則你要後悔的。used to emphasize indefinite words or phrases beginning with「some」（as sb．，sth．，somewhere，somehow，sometime）（用以表示不肯定或不準確之意）某一
*I shall be coming again some day or other．我總有一天還會來的。
*I've read the story before in some book or other．我以前在哪本書上讀過這個故事。
*Somehow or other，John managed to get a wellpaid job in the bank．不知怎麼地，約翰在銀行找到了一份薪水高的工作。it would be better to say更確切地說
*He came home very late last night，or rather very early this morning．他昨天深夜，或者更確切地說，今天凌晨才回家。about大約
*I'll return in a week or so．我大約一星期後回來。
*There will be thirty or so people at the party．約有30人左右參加聚會。showing that the speaker is not sure（不能十分肯定）或是什麼；或是做點什麼
*Don't idle away your time；do some writing or something．別虛度光陰，寫點東西或是做點別的什麼事兒。
*Haven't seen you for a long time．Have you been on business or something？好久沒見你了。是出差了還是怎麼的？o.ra pro no.bis
