棕櫚葉
(用以制扇、帽子等)1．get rid of sth． one does not want by persuading sb． to accept or buy it用欺騙手段把…處理掉
*He palmed his old washing machine off on his aunt，even though he knew it was always breaking down．他把他那台舊洗衣機硬給他姑媽，儘管他知道這機器老出毛病。
*There should be alaw against people palming off rubbish like this．應該有一項禁止人們兜售這類劣質品的法令。
2．deceive by a trick or lie欺騙
*He tried to palm his boss off with the story that he had been to the dentist．他企圖欺騙他老闆說他去看牙醫了。
*He has palmed off all that rubbish on the public．他以一派胡言欺騙了公眾。palm oil
