→ part
<<及物動詞>>
(par.celed,(英)-celled; par.cel.ing,(英)-cel.ling)
1 分…,分配<out>
2 把…作成包裹 [小包] <up>divide sth．into parts， shares or portions把…分成幾份
*After his death， his land was parcelled out among his family．他死後，他的土地分成了幾份給了他的家人。
*He parcelled out the remaining food to the workers．他將剩餘的食物分給工人。parcel post
