<<副詞>>
以包裹郵件
send it ~ 
以包裹郵件寄送該物make into a parcel把…包起來
*He parcelled up some games and toys to take to the Children's Home．他包起一些遊戲用具和玩具，拿到兒童之家去。
*They parcelled up the books and posted them．他們把書包好寄出去了。
*pare down reduce or minimise sth．，esp．costs， expenditure，etc．削減；削掉
*If we're going on holiday，we must pare down all our other expenses．如果要去度假，我們就得削減其它一切開支。
*With less money coming in they had to pare down their household expenses．收入減少了，他們不得不緊縮家庭開支。
*With a knife he pared down the stick．他用刀子把那根木棒削細。par.ce.nar.y
