*Jack had spent all his money and got into debt， so now he must pay the piper．傑克把錢花光並欠了債，現在他可要自作自受了。pay at a very high rate；pay too much付出高價
*There was a shortage of cars；if you found one for sale，you had to pay through the nose．汽車缺貨，如果有賣，也得出高價。
