~ one's head up 
昂然抬頭1．raise （the head， tail，ears，etc．） briskly or spiritedly昂（首）；翹（尾）；豎起（耳朵等）
*The dog perked up its ears．狗豎起了耳朵。
2．become or cause to become lively and active活躍起來；振作起來
*She perked up when I suggested that we go to the theatre that evening．當我建議我們那天晚上去看戲時她可來勁了。
*As the spring came on， the patient began to perk up．春天一到，病人的精神就開始好起來了。Per.kin
