(亦稱 phase microscope)introduce sth．gradually or in stage 逐步採用；分階段引入
*They phased in the new course by accepting just five students in the first year， and ten in the second．他們逐步發展新專業，第一年只收5個學生，第二年收了10個學生。
*They've decided to phase the new techniques in．他們已決定逐步引進那些新技術。phase microscope
<<可數名詞>>
