<<可數名詞>>
鼓身蛇
(一種非洲產的毒蛇,興奮時身體會膨脹)puff box
粉盒1．cause to swell使脹起
*The toothache puffed out one side of his face．牙疼使得他的半邊臉腫了起來。
*The boy confidently puffed out his chest．男孩信心十足地挺起胸膛。
*She puffed out the story quite a lot．她把這件事大肆渲染。
2．blow out吹滅
*A sudden gust of wind from the open window puffed the candle out．從窗口突然吹進來一陣風，把蠟燭吹滅了。
*She puffed out the candle as soon as the child went to sleep．孩子一睡著，她就吹熄了蠟燭。
3．cause to become short of breath 使氣喘
*Climbing up the long staircase to his office quite puffed me out．爬這麼高的樓梯到他辦公室，簡直使我喘不過氣來。
*We ran so hard that we were all puffed out when we got there．我們拚命跑，跑到那兒一個個氣喘吁吁的。puff paste
