*He rattled thuough his work in half an hour．他很快地在半小時內做完了工作。
*The speaker rattled through his speech，failing to keep the interest of the crowd．那位演講者很快就講完了話，但是沒能把握住聽眾的興趣。say quickly without having to stop to think；recite easily and rapidly 不用思考而滔滔不絕地說出；背誦如流
*We asked the waitress what flavors of ice cream she had，and she rattled them off．我們問女服務員有些什麼樣的冰淇淋，她不加思索地說出了一大串。
*The professor rattled off a list of books that would be useful in studying the topic．這位教授報出了一串對研究這個專題有用的書籍。rat.tle.box
