教堂在天空襯托下顯得輪廓分明1．take from sb．；free sb．from替…拿；使某人免於
*Let me relieve you of that heavy parcel．讓我替你提那個重包。
*You'd better relieve Mary of some of the housework．你最好減輕一點瑪麗的家務活。
2．dismiss from（a position）解除（某人職務）
*The captain was relieved of his post when his guilt was proved．證明有罪之後，船長被解除了職務。
