疾病常由貧窮引起
2 (結果) 歸[於…],終歸,終於[in]
The plan ~ed in failure. 
那項計畫終於失敗
The trial ~ed in his being acquitted. 
審判的結果是他被判無罪be the effect of sth．由…引起；由…產生
*Success results from hard work．成功來自於努力工作。
*Any damage resulting from negligence must be paid by the borrower．因疏忽引起的任何損壞須由借方負責賠償。
*His illness resulted from bad food．他的病是由於吃了變質的食物引起的。cause；lead to；bring about the result that導致；造成…成果
*The accident resulted in the death of two passengers．這場事故造成兩名乘客死亡。
*Compulsion will never result in convincing them．壓制決不可能使他們信服。
*His carelessness results in a serious blunder．他的粗枝大葉致使他犯了一個嚴重錯誤。re.sul.tant
