輪狀細胞1． give signal for lowering（the curtain）鳴鈴閉幕；落幕
*When the curtain was rung down on the first performance，the audience broke into enthusiastic applause．當第一個節目演完，鳴鈴落幕時，觀眾報以熱烈的掌聲。
2 ． bring about a conclusion告終；完畢；竣工
*I'm sorry to hear that they have decided to ring down the curtain on their marriage．聽說他們要離婚，我感到很遺憾。ring finger
