在點名之前回來roll film
<<名詞>>
攝影膠卷1． come in great volume or quantity 滾滾而來；大量湧進
*Good news keeps rolling in from our scientific and technological fronts．我國科技戰線上捷報頻傳。
*Offers of help are rolling in．大量的援助滾滾而來。
2．luxuriate in；abound in；have a good deal of（money，etc．）沉溺於；富於
*He's rolling in money，since he's inherited his rich father 's fortune．由於繼承了富有的父親的遺產，他成了腰纏萬貫的富翁。
3．go to bed就寢
*The old professor rolled in late every night．這位老教授每天很晚才睡覺。
*roll off print，duplicate by passing paper etc．through the rollers of a machine通過（機器）印出；複製出
*You can quickly roll off a few copies of the exercise on the duplicating machine．你可以在複印機上很快地把這個練習複印幾份。1．make flat and smooth by pressing with a roller，or rollingpin碾平；ŋ平
*She rolled out the dough in order to make a few pies．她把麵團壓平做了幾個餡餅。
2．come forth copiously；make a deep and sonorous sound 滔滔不絕地說出；洪亮地講出或唱出
*The actor rolled out his words so that everyone in the theatre could hear．那位演員聲音洪亮地朗誦台詞，以使劇場裡的每一個人都能聽到。
*She rolled out these verses emotionally．她充滿激情地朗誦這些詩句。1．welcome with ceremony 正式歡迎
*They rolled out the red carpet for the visiting president and his party．他們隆重歡迎前來訪問的總統一行。
2．greet with great respect and honor ；give a hearty welcome熱烈接待；恭敬地迎接 Jerry 's family rolled out the red carpet for his teacher when he called．傑裡的老師來家訪時，全家人都熱情地歡迎他。roll past
(閱兵中) 重武器分列通過1．wrap up 包起來
*He rolled himself up in a blanket．他用毯子把自己裹了起來。
2．accumulate；collect；increase積累；增加
*Thrift and diligence make him roll up a fortune．勤儉使他積累了很大一筆錢財。
*His debts rolled up as he couldn 't pay them in time．他無力及時還清債務，因此債台越壘越高。
3．arrive， appear on the scene ；come up in large numbers ；arrive in a vehicle 到場；出現；湧來；乘車到達
*The whole family rolled up to their daughter 's first appearance on the stage．全家人都到場觀看他們的女兒初次登台演出。
*The visitors rolled up to the hotel at eight sharp．參觀者 8點整到達旅館。
*Just when we had given up all hope of their coming，they rolled up in a taxi．正當我們放棄了希望，以為他們不會來時，他們卻乘坐出租車到了。
4．make into or form a roll捲起
*He rolled up his sleeves and set to work at once．他捲起袖子，立即開始工作。
*He rolled up his umbrella．他收起了傘。
*root about/around search about 到處搜查
*He rooted around for his notebook．他到處尋找他的筆記本。
*She has been rooting about for her lost daughter．她一直在尋找她失蹤的女兒。roll-call
