(1) → v.t. 1 b
(2) 完成…,使…完全1．along the circumference of； all around在（…的）四周
*He lives somewhere round about．他就住在這附近。
*The white building contrasts pleasantly with the green pines round about．那幢潔白的樓房同四周蔥翠的松樹相互輝映，賞心悅目。
