e.[在…]磨成…[in]
He rubbed a hole in the knees of his trousers. 
他在褲子的膝蓋上磨了一個洞
2 
a. [在…上]擦<身體等>,摩擦… [against,on,over] 
The cat was rubbing itself [its head] against her legs. 
那隻貓在她腿上摩擦身體 [頭] 
b. [在…]擦 <蠟等> ,塗…,抹…,用力擦入… [on,over,in,into] 
