send
[sZnd; sˏnd]
<<及物動詞>>
1 送,寄
a. 送,傳遞,傳達 <東西、訊息等> ; 發[打] <電報等> 
~ a gift 
送禮物
~ a letter [parcel] by mail 
郵寄信件 [包裹] 
~ a telegram 
打 [發] 電報
~ word 
傳話
He sent a congratulatory message. 
他寄賀詞 [拍賀電] 來
b. 寄給[某人] <物品、賀詞等> [to]
He sent me a letter of appreciation. = He sent a letter of appreciation to me. 
他寄給我一封謝函
S~ her my best regards. 
請代我向她致意 [問好] 
c. 寄<東西> (到…) 
He sent the package by airmail to Europe. 
他 (用) 航空郵寄包裹到歐洲
They sent the manuscript back. 
他們寄還原稿
d. 把<東西>送出去
You should ~ that coat to be cleaned. 
你應該把那件上衣送去洗
2 (命令、委託等而) 使…前往
a. 派遣 <人、軍隊等> 
~ troops 
派遣軍隊
b. 使<某人> (去…) ,派遣<某人> (去…) 
~ a son to school 
送兒子上學
~ a child to bed 
叫小孩去睡覺
~ a servant on an errand 
差遣傭人去辦事
~ a boy home 
把男孩送回家
be sent into the world 
被送入這世界,出生
~ an ambassador abroad 
派遣大使駐國外
I sent him to her with a message. 
我派他帶話給她
c. (文語)派 <使者等> 到<某人處>
I sent him a messenger. 
我派一位使者到他那裡
d. 差<人>去買 [請] …[for]
I sent him for some milk. 
我差他去買一些牛奶
S~ someone for the doctor. 
差人去請醫生來
e. 差<人>去做…
I sent her to fetch some sugar from the kitchen. 
我差她去廚房拿一些糖
3 a. 迫使,促使…成為[…狀態][to, into]
~ a person to his death 
置某人於死地
The music sent him to sleep. 
音樂促使他入睡
Her remark sent him into a rage. 
她的話使他勃然大怒
b. 使<人、物等>…
The blow sent him spinning. 
那一拳打得他搖搖晃晃
Inflation has sent food costs soaring. 
通貨膨脹使食物價格飛漲
c. 使<人、物等> <成為…> 
The smell is ~ing me crazy!. 
那種氣味使我受不了
4 
a. 投<球>,發射 <箭、火箭等> [到…][to]
~ an arrow 
射箭
~ a rocket to another planet 
發射火箭到另一行星
b. [朝著…] 給予<打擊等>[to]
~ a punch to the chin 
朝著下巴給予一拳
5 a. <天然物> 射出<光>,冒出 <煙> ,放出 <熱等> [於 …] <forth,out> [to, into]
Mt. Vesuvius is constantly ~ing forth steam into the air. 
維蘇威火山不斷向空中冒出氣體
b. <樹木>發 <芽> ,長出 <樹枝等> <forth,out> 
~ out leaves 
長出葉子
6 a. 送出 <電流、電磁波> ; 發出<信號>
~ a current [signal] 
送出電流 [發出信號] 
b. 使 <興奮、恐懼等> 發生
The news sent a thrill through him. 
那消息使他全身振奮
The sight sent cold shivers down [up(and down)] my back. 
那景象使我的背脊感到一陣冷顫
7(文語)
a. <上帝>賜給,准許
May God ~ help!. 
願上帝賜救!
b. <上帝>施予<人>…; 施予…[給人][to]
May God ~ us rain! = May God ~ rain to us!. 
願上帝賜雨給我們!
God ~ you better health!. 
願上帝保佑你更健康
c. <上帝>准許…
Heaven ~ (that) my son comes back safely. 
願上天保佑我兒子平安回來
d. <上帝>使<人><成…狀態>
S~ her [him] victorious!. 
上帝賜給她(女王) [他(國王)] 勝利!
8(口語) <音樂、藝術等> 使 <聽眾、演奏者> 狂熱[興奮]
His music really ~s me. 
他的音樂真使我激動
<<不及物動詞>>
1 a. 派人來,傳消息
If you want me, please ~. 
如果你需要我,請派人來 [通知我] 
b. 差 (人) 去 [拿[叫]…] ; [需求…而] 訂購[for]
~ for a doctor 
派人去請醫生
The doctor has been sent for. 
已經派人去請醫生了
I'll ~ for the book. 
我要訂購那本書
c. 派,差[人]做…[to]
They sent to me to come. 
他們派人叫我來
We sent to invite her to supper. 
我們差人去邀請她來吃晚餐
2 發出信號
send a person about his business 
→ business.
send after?
(1) (使…) 隨在…的後面
(2) 傳話給…
send away
(1) 趕走,解雇
~ away a servant 
解僱傭人
I was sent away in disgrace. 
我因失寵而被解雇
(2) 把…送到遠方
We sent our son away to school in France. 
我們把兒子遠送至法國求學
(3) 從遠方取得[…], (郵) 購[for]
We have to ~ away for a catalog. 
我們必須去函訂購 [索取] 目錄
send down
(1) 使…下降
~ prices down 
使物價下降
(2)(英口語)將<人>關入監獄
(3)『英大學』勒令<某人>退學,開除<某人>
(4) [向廚房等] 要[…][to][for]
I'll ~ down to the kitchen for some more coffee. 
我要廚房再送些咖啡來
send in
(1) 把<人>請進 (房間等) 
S~ him in. 
請他進來
(2) 郵寄; 提出 <辭呈、申請書等> ; 遞 <名片等> 給接待員
(3) 將 <繪畫等> 送出 [展示] ; 使<選1．cause to depart 使離開；送走
*He sent his son away to school in America．他把兒子送往美國唸書。
*The letter was sent away in the evening mail．那封信是夜間郵班送出的。
2．dismiss 開除；趕走
*Send the boy away，Mary；he is a little nuisance．瑪麗，把孩子打發走，他是一個小討厭鬼。
*The boss sent little Jack away on some pretext or other．老闆用某種借口把小傑克開除了。request by post 寫信索要
*He sent away to one of the daily papers for a free calendar．他寫信向一家日報社免費索取一份年歷。
*He wants to send away for some books．他想寫信郵購一些書。1．expel a student from a universi ty 開除
*As a result of the inquiry，two stu dents have been sent down．調查結果，兩個學生被勒令退學。
2．cause to go down 使下降 Perhaps that will send her temper ature down．那樣或許會使她的熱度降下去。
*The glut of apples sent the prices down．蘋果大量上市使價格降了下來。1．ask sb．to attend 請…來
*Send for a doctor；a man has been hurt．去請醫生，有人受傷了。
*The police were sent for immedi ately the disturbance began．騷亂剛一開始，警察就被叫來了。
2．send an order for sth．訂購
*I have sent for a dozen copies of the book．這書我訂購了12本。
*If you wish to see the book，I'll send for a copy．你要是想看這本書，我就去訂購一本。1．produce 長出（枝、芽等）
*Trees send forth new leaves in spring．春天裡樹木長出新葉。
2．emit；pour out 發出；使流出
*The sun sends forth light and heat．太陽發出光和熱。
*The plant sends forth billows of smoke and steam．那家工廠放出滾滾濃煙和蒸汽。
3．issue；dispatch 寄發
*The parcel must be sent forth at once．這包裹必須馬上寄出。
*They sent forth lots of people into the harvest．他們派出許多人參加收割。1．hand in 遞送；呈送
*Have they sent in the accounts？他們把帳單交上來了嗎？
*He has already sent in his resigna tion．他已提出了辭職。
*Applications must be sent in by May 5．申請書必須於5月5日前交上來。
2．send for a competition or an ex hibition 送…參加比賽或展出
*Send in your contest entries to this station．把參加比賽的名單送到本站來。
*We sent in two pictures for the show．我們送去兩幅畫參展。1．post 郵寄
*Have you sent off that letter yet？那封信你寄了嗎？
2．see off 為…送行；送別
*A great crowd gathered at the sta tion to send the football team off．一大群人聚集在車站為足球隊送行。1．send ahead or in advance 先送；先遣
*We'll have our luggage sent on by train．我們把行李先交火車運去。
*The sales manger had pressing business which kept him Shang hai，so he sent his deputy on to represent him in Guangzhou．銷售部經理因急事耽擱在上海，因此他派副手前往廣州做他的代表。
2．readdress and repost 轉寄；轉送
*Would you kindly send on the en closed letter to Xiao Wang？勞駕把附來的信轉交給小王好嗎？
*I'll send on any letters that come for you．給你的信我都將轉給你。1．emit 發出（光亮等）
*This lamp sends out a powerful beam．這種燈可發出強光。
2．produce 長出（枝、葉）
*Trees send out new shoots in spring．樹木入春就長出新芽。
3．dispatch 派遣；發送
*He sends out many invitations．他發出了許多請柬。
*The company sends out thousands of circulars every month．這家公司每月發出數以千計的通知。1．cause to go upward 使上升；提高；加大；發射
*Any increase in production costs is bound to send up prices．生產成本一提高就必然引起物價上漲。
*The climbers sent two men up to in vestigate the rockfall．登山者派兩個人上去調查滾石情況。
*The distressed ship sent up a flare．遇難的船向空中發出了閃光信號。
2．destroy 毀壞
*The terrorists sent the bridge up．恐怖分子炸毀了大橋。
3．ridicule sb．or sth．esp．by imi tating 諷刺性模仿
*The play sends up the advertising industry．該劇是諷刺廣告業的。
*The students here love to send up the staff．這裡的學生愛模仿教職員的動作取笑。
4．sentence sb．to imprisonment判…入獄
*Do you know that Milton was sent up for fifteen years？你知道彌爾頓被判刑15年嗎？inform；notify 告知
*He sent word to me that he would not be able to come．他通知我說，他不能來了。
*Xiao Zhang has just sent word． She'll be a little late．剛剛帶信來說，她可能會晚到一會兒。send-off
