1『廣播』收播
2(俚)停止講話

1． mark the end of a radio or television programme for the day結束廣播
*This is your favorite announcer signing off for tonight．這是你最喜歡的播音員在結束今晚的廣播。
*The local station signs off at midnight．地方台午夜停止廣播。
2．end a letter結束書信
*I must sign off now．Love，Mary．就止停筆。愛你的，瑪麗。
3．stop work for the day停止工作
*Because of the snow，we signed off at three o'clock．由於下雪，我們3點鐘就下班了。
*The man signed off work at half past six．那人在6點半下班。sign on
『廣播』開播

1．sign an agreement to work for a company；join a team簽約受雇
*He signed on yesterday and will start work on Monday．他昨天簽訂了合同，星期一就要上班。
*He signed on for another six years．他簽約再工作6年。
2．begin a radio programme for the day電台開始廣播
*The BBC signs on at six o'clock every morning．BBC廣播每天早上6點開始廣播。
3．register as unemployed at an office of the Department of Health and Social Security in Britain 在英國就業部地方辦事處辦理失業登記
*When the steel works closed， a thousand men had to sign on ．當鋼鐵廠關閉時，1000名工人只得去辦理失業登記手續。indicate one's departure by signing a register簽名登記離開
*We signed out of college on Friday evening and returned on Monday morning．我們星期五晚上登記離校，星期一早上回校。
*I'll sign them out and guarantee their good behavior．我給他們簽字放行，保證他們行為端正。sign painter
