*Mike earns a good wage， but he doesn't save a penny． Money just slips through his fingers．邁克收入不錯，但他不存一分錢，錢都被他花掉了。
*The opportunity will slip through your fingers if you do not seize it．這個機會你不抓住的話，就會錯過的。make a mistake失誤
*If he had not slipped up on the last question， his score on the test would have been perfect．最後一個問題如果他沒出現失誤的話，他的考試成績就是滿分了。
*Be careful you don't slip up through overconfidence．小心，別因過分自信而犯錯誤。
