*Several students stayed behind after the lecture to ask questions．有幾個學生課後留下來問問題。remain indoors留在家中
*I'll stay in to wait for his telephone call．我將留在家中等他的電話。
*Let's stay in tonight and read instead of going to a movie．咱們今晚不去看電影，呆在家裡看書吧。1．continue to be at a distance from保持距離
*Tell the children to stay off the road．叫孩子們離開公路遠點。
2．avoid避開
*The doctor advised him to stay off fattening．醫生建議他不要吃高脂肪食物。
*You'll have to stay off beer if you really want to lose weight．如果你真想減肥，就不能再喝啤酒了。
3．not go to school，work，etc．不上學；不上班
*I don't feel very well．I think I'll stay off tomorrow and have a day in bed．我今天感到不舒服，明天我不去上班了，在床上躺一天。prolong one's stay繼續呆下去；繼續留下去
*I'll stay on this evening and help you，if you like．如果你願意，我今晚留下來幫你。
*He is staying on at school for another year．他在學校還要再呆一年。
*He came for a week's holiday and stayed on a month．他來度假，假期只有一周，他卻住了一個月。1．remain away from home不在家
*She stayed out last night until four o'clock．她昨夜4點才回家。
2．continue to refuse to work繼續拒絕工作
*All the workers are staying out until their demands are met．所有工人都拒絕復工，直到滿足他們的要求。remain in the same place呆在原處；停留在原處
*There，I've fixed the handle，and it should stay put now．現在我已經把把手固定好了，它不會再掉下來了。
*Harry's father told him to stay put until he came back．哈里的父親吩咐兒子不要離開，等他回來。1．continue to be high不下降If his temperature stays up all day，call the doctor．假如他的體溫居高不下，就請醫生吧。
*The temporary roof won't stay up much longer．那臨時屋頂挺不了多久。
2．remain late out of bed遲睡Please don't stay up for me，I may be late．不要遲睡等我，我可能會晚回來的。
*He stays up late most nights，reading business reports．他常常熬夜看業務報告。1．live with與…住在一起
*Tom is now staying with us．湯姆現在與我們住在一起。
*She stayed with her aunt while she was in Shanghai．她在上海時住在她姑媽家裡。
2．hold out（a task，a contest，etc．）；last out使…持續下去；使維持下去
*We must stay with the task as long as we can．這個任務我們能堅持多久就要堅持多久。
*Ted stayed with his homework until it was done．泰德堅持把作業做完。
3．be together with sb．；not leave與…留在一起；不離開
*Stay with me until we get out of the crowd．不要分開，跟著我走出人群。
4．continue to listen even though one may be tempted to go away繼續聽…說下去
*Just stay with me a minute longer．I'm sure l can convince you．再聽我講一下，我肯定可以說服你們。stay-at-home
