1．increase；accelerate增加；促進Trade has been stepping up recently，since the weather turned warmer．因天氣轉暖，最近貿易不斷增加。
*Radio and television have stepped up the tempo of the news．收音機和電視機加快了新聞的傳送速度。
2．walk up；go or come near向上走；走近
*John stepped up onto the plat form and began to speak．約翰走上講台開始發言。
3．be promoted晉陞；提升
*He has stepped up into the management of the firm．他升入了公司的管理部門。
