( [p,b,t,d,k,g] 等 :c1．stay in a place逗留在；停在For two days we stopped at a lovely inn in the mountains．我們在山區一個迷人的小酒店裡逗留了兩天。
*The car stopped at the gas station．車子停在加油站。
2．hesitate at對…有所躊躇
*She is one of those women who stop at nothing to get what she wants．她是那種為了滿足個人慾望而不顧一切的女人。
*The greedy boss stopped at nothing to gain profit．貪婪的老闆為了攫取利潤而無所不為。stay away不在；不出席
*Why did you stop away from the meeting？We expected to see you there．你怎麼沒去開會？我們原指望能在那兒見到你。
*He stopped away from the lecture when he found out it wasn't interesting．他發現那講座沒意思，便走了。make a brief call順便訪問
*We were passing your house，so we thought we would stop by for a few minutes．我們路過你家，所以就想順便進來坐一會。
*We suggested that she stop by that evening to talk things over．我們建議她在那晚順便來找我們，把事情商量一下。stop clause
提早終止契約條款
(可在某種情形下提早終止契約的條款,常為劇團與戲院主之間的約定)stop drill
(帶有凸肩可限制鑽進深度的) 鑽頭prevent from使…停止；阻止
*How do you stop children from playing with matches？你是如何阻止小孩玩火的？
*Be careful to stop the instrument from falling down．注意防止儀器掉下來。1．stay at home留在家裡
*I'm stopping in tonight to wash my hair．今晚我不出去，我要洗頭。
*I'll stop in and look after the kids．我要留在家看孩子。
2．remain at school late as a punishment留在學校以示懲罰
*If there is any more trouble，you will all stop in for two hours．如果還出問題，那你們放學後都將留兩個小時。stop knob
風琴音鈕stop motion
縮時攝影術pay a short informal visit，usu．in passing順便造訪
*Do stop off on your way home and have a cup of tea with me．回家途中請你務必順便來我家喝茶。
*They stopped off to pick up some food．他們在半路上停下來弄點吃的。stop order
規定價格成交命令1．remain out of doors or away from home在外面
*She stopped out until one o'clock and her father was furious．她在外面一直呆到一點鐘，她父親非常生氣。
*Don't stop out too long．不要在外面呆得太久。
2．remain on strike繼續罷工
*The workers decided to stop out until their conditions of work were improved．工人們決定繼續罷工，直到他們的工作條件得到改善。break a journey中途停留
*He stopped over in Paris for a day．他途中在巴黎停留了一天。stop payment
