非直通街道
(車輛在進入幹道前必須在街口停車的街道)1．not go to bed不睡覺
*We will be home late，so please do not stop up for us．我們回來得遲，請不要為我們守夜。
*She often stops up till he gets home．她常等他回家後才睡。
2．seal up封住；堵住
*The gutter was stopped up with fallen leaves and the rain water could not flow away．水溝被落葉塞住了，雨水流不出去。
*She stopped up her ears to keep the noise out．她堵住耳朵隔絕噪音。
*My nose is stopped up with the cold．我的鼻子因感冒不通氣。stop valve
