*The band struck up as soon as the Queen stepped on the shore．女王一登岸，樂隊就開始奏樂。
2．begin a friendship with sb．建立起友誼
*They struck up an acquaintance with each other on the beach and soon became very friendly．他們是在海灘上相互認識的，而且很快就建立起了友誼。
