*She was stringing out the clothes on the washing line when it started to rain．她正把衣服晾在曬衣繩上的時候，天開始下雨了。
*The police strung out across the field looking for clues．警察按一定距離散開，在田里尋找線索。
2．prolong；extend 延長；拖長
*The refugees were strung out along the dusty roads for miles．難民們沿著塵土飛揚的道路連成幾里長的人流向前走著。
*The promised three days strung out to six weeks．原先答應3天，結果延長到6個星期之久。string player
