『圖書館學』書籍目錄
(按書籍性質分類者)subject index
標題索引; 主題索引subject matter
<<不可數名詞>>
內容; 主題,題目1．bring under control 使遭受；使受制於
*We are all subjected to the law of nature．我們全都受自然規律的支配。
*Women have been subjected to unjust treatment for too long．很長時間以來，婦女一直受到歧視。
2．make sth．undergo a test，treatment，etc．使…經歷
*All cars are subjected to various tests before they leave the factory．在離開工廠前，所有的車輛都要經過各種各樣的測試。
*Such an action would subject you to severe criticism．這種行動將使你遭受到嚴厲批評。
3．under the control of 受制約的
*You are subject to the laws of this country．你得遵守這個國家的法律。
4．likely to get or have易遭受的
*John is in rather poor health and is subject to colds．約翰身體很弱，易患感冒。
*The western plains are subject to tornadoes．西部平原常遭受龍捲風的襲擊。
5．depending on some change，happening or need有待…的；須經…的
*Our plans may change subject to the weather．我們的計劃可能因氣候而會改變。
*The treaty is subject to ratification．該條約須經批准。sub.jec.ti.fy
