<<名詞>>
1 (C)總計,總額,總數[of]
2 [the ~]要旨,精華[of]1．express briefly the chief points of what has been said 總結；歸納
*Please sum up the main points of the text in three sentences．請用3句話總結這篇課文的主要觀點。
*To sum up，for the reasons I have just given，I think my plan is better．從我剛才所述的理由綜合起來看，我認為我的計劃比較好。
*The judge summed up for twenty minutes．法官作了20分鐘的概述。
2．form a judgement or opinion of 判斷
*He could sum up situations at a glance．他只要看一眼就能對形勢作出判斷。
*When he walked in，I quickly summed him up．他走進來時，我很快就對他有所品評。sum-
