an ~ servant 僕役的下手,打雜的傭人1．under suspicion； not trusted被懷疑
*With the theft of the jewels cleared up， he was no longer under a cloud．由於珠寶盜竊案已經查清，他不再受到懷疑了。too young； not old enough； below legal age未成年的；未到法定的年齡
*He could not join the army because he was under age．他不能參軍，因為他不夠年齡。
*The son cannot have the control of his property，for he is under age．兒子因為尚未成年，所以不能佔有他的財產。on the pretext of以…為借口；在…的幌子下
*There are infamous hypocrites who promote their own advantage under color of the public good．有些無恥的偽君子假公濟私，謀取私利。
*The man extorted money under color of philanthropy from quite a number of people．那人打著慈善的幌子，從不少人那兒撈取錢財。being considered；given careful thought在考慮中；在研究中
*Your proposals are still under consideration．你的建議仍在考慮之中。
*The matter is at present under consideration．那件事目前正在考慮。under authority；under restraint 在…控制之下
*They have got flood waters under control．他們已使氾濫的洪水受到了控制。
*I noticed that my legs are not well under control．我發覺我的兩條腿不聽使喚。knowing that one may need to be corrected不一定全對；有待指正
*That is my opinion，but I speak under correction．那只是我的看法，請指正。hidden；concealed隱藏；掩蔽
*He kept his invention under cover until it was patented．在取得專利權以前，他對他的發明一直保守秘密。securely kept妥善保管；置於極安全之處
*The important documents are all under lock and key．重要文件都已妥善保存起來了。never；whatever may happen決不；無論在何種情況下都不
*I made up my mind that under no circumstances would I agree to such a decision．我決心在任何情況下都不同意這樣的決定。in an easily seen or noticeable place 在…眼前；在明顯的地方
*The thier walked out of the museum with the painting，right under the nose of the guards．那位小偷帶著名畫，就在守衛人員的眾目睽睽之下走出了博物館。on earth；in the world（used for emphasis）在世界上（用於強調）
*Nothing under the sun is too difficult if you set your mind to it．世上無難事，只怕有心人。
*The President's assassination shocked everyone under the sun．總統的遇刺使全世界為之震驚。unwell，although not seriously ill 不舒服
*Brian is feeling under the weather，so he's going to bed early tonight．布萊恩不舒服，因此今晚他睡覺很早。
*I was a bit under the weather last week，but I'm all right now．我上星期身體有點不舒服，但現在好了。1．through the water；in motion （said of a vessel starting out）（指船）在航行之中；在前進途中
*The ship is under way for London．這艘船正在前往倫敦的途中。
2．making progress or having started正在進行中；已開始
*Preparations for the celebration of National Day are under way．慶祝國慶的準備工作正在進行之中。
*Our plan is well under way．我們的計劃正在順利地實施之中。

