*He is working at a new subject．他正在研究一門新的學科。
*You will have to work at the weak points if you want to pass the examination．你要想考試過關就得在你的薄弱環節上下功夫。
2．do sth．with effort 在…上下功夫
*You'll crack this problem if you really work at it．只要你下功夫就能解決這個問題。keep on working 繼續干；一個勁地幹下去
*He has been working away without a rest ever since breakfast．他從早飯後就一直在忙個不停。
*She is still working away at her homework．她還在做作業。work camp
1 (囚犯) 勞動營
2 (宗教的) 勤務勞動所work car
